<title>UK: SOCCER-NORTHERN IRISH LEAGUE PREMIER DIVISION RESULTS/STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-NORTHERN IRISH LEAGUE PREMIER DIVISION RESULTS/STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>BELFAST 1996-11-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Northern Irish premier</p>
<p>division soccer matches on Saturday:</p>
<p> Coleraine    0   Cliftonville   1</p>
<p> Crusaders    0   Linfield	 1</p>
<p> Glentoran    2   Glenavon	 2</p>
<p> Portadown    0   Ards	     1</p>
<p>Standings (tabulated under played, won, drawn, lost, goals</p>
<p>for, against, points):</p>
<p> Coleraine		 9  7  1  1  18  10  22</p>
<p> Linfield		  9  4  3  2  12   8  15</p>
<p> Crusaders		 9  3  3  3  11   9  12</p>
<p> Portadown		 8  3  2  3  10  11  11</p>
<p> Glenavon		  9  2  4  3  13  13  10</p>
<p> Ards			9  3  1  5  12  17  10</p>
<p> Glentoran		 9  2  3  4  17  18   9</p>
<p> Cliftonville	    8  1  3  4   4  11   6</p>
